  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide Medical Treatment &amp; Save Frank from Cancer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support Mr Frank, to receive all the necessary medical treatment he needs in order to become healthy again. Mr Frank, who is a native of Lilu in Ihiala Local Government Area of Anambra State, use to be a successful trader until the year 2019, when he was diagnosed with cancer of the neck. He has exhausted his savings trying to save his life and his health is now fast deteriorating with no money to support him and finance his treatment. Remain blessed as you donate to save him.</narrative>
  </description>
